<h1 class="title">LEMBAR KERJA PRE-LAB &bull; MODUL 4</h1>
<h2 class="subtitle">Software Quality Assurance: White-Box Testing (Statement &amp; Branch Coverage)</h2>

<div class="meta-box">
    <table class="meta-table">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 20%;"><strong>Nama Praktikan</strong></td>
            <td style="width: 30%;">: MUCHAMMAD DWI FERDI ILHAM ARIFIN</td>
            <td style="width: 20%;"><strong>Mata Kuliah</strong></td>
            <td style="width: 30%;">: Praktikum Pengujian Kualitas Perangkat Lunak</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>NIM</strong></td>
            <td>: 202310370311292</td>
